                    <h4 style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:#111111;"><strong>The Challenge: </strong>Workforce Instability</span></h4>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="font-size:20px;">The Salvation Army Tampa Area Command is currently facing critical workforce challenges that jeopardize our ability to deliver essential services to those experiencing homelessness.</span>
</p>





<h5 style="text-align:center;">Key Issues Identified:</h5>




<style type="text/css"> .challenges-container, .challenges-container  {
