<div class="sm-card-container">
	<div class="sm-card-column">
		<h6 style="text-align:center;">Reduced Burnout</h6>

		<p style="text-align:center;">
			<span style="font-size:20px;">At least <strong>70%</strong> of participants will report lower stress levels.</span>
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="sm-card-column">
		<h6 style="text-align:center;">Improved Retention</h6>

		<p style="text-align:center;">
			<span style="font-size:20px;">Case manager turnover projected to decrease by <strong>15%</strong> within one year.</span>
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="sm-card-column">
		<h6 style="text-align:center;">Stronger Service Delivery</h6>

		<p style="text-align:center;">
			<span style="font-size:20px;">More stable workforce = better housing placements and client outcomes.</span>
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="sm-card-column">
		<h6 style="text-align:center;">Enhanced Engagement</h6>

		<p style="text-align:center;">
			<span style="font-size:20px;">Training increases effectiveness and builds a more resilient, skilled team.</span>
		</p>
