<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:11:60"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/e62b586b-ccb4-48ff-93f8-ae529416ca4d_Recurso%2B3%402xtampa52.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:12:31">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#111111;">
                    <p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="color:#ffffff;">The Workforce Resilience Initiative directly addresses one of the most pressing barriers to effective homeless services: burnout and turnover among case managers. By investing in the emotional, professional, and structural support of our staff, this project creates a more resilient team and a stronger pathway out of homelessness for the people we serve.</span>
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="color:#ffffff;">We thank you for your consideration and the opportunity to strengthen our impact in the Tampa community.</span>
